@server = http://localhost:4004
@svc = {{server}}/odata/v4/customer360

### All interactions, newest first
GET {{svc}}/Interactions?$orderby=contactDate desc

### All opportunities
GET {{svc}}/Opportunities

### Log a new call
POST {{svc}}/Interactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerID": "1000002", "type": "Call", "contactDate": "{{$datetime 'YYYY-MM-DD'}}", "summary": "Asked about the 2027 price list.", "salesRep": "Ben Carter" }

### A customer number that does not exist. In the starter, this is SAVED. You fix it in step 6.
POST {{svc}}/Interactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerID": "9999999", "type": "Visit", "contactDate": "{{$datetime 'YYYY-MM-DD'}}", "summary": "Who is this?", "salesRep": "Ben Carter" }
